{
  "$comment": "讲解画面的视觉主题——颜色、排版与动效的唯一真源。TS 侧由 palette.ts 读，Python 侧由 m2v.engine.themes 读：准备阶段要用主题的动效帧数编译时间轴，两处各写一份的话「改主题」只会改到一半，另一半留在 Python 里不跟着动。",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "default": "dark",
  "themes": {
    "dark": {
      "colors": {
        "bg": "#111720",
        "ink": "#f3f4f6",
        "muted": "#c8d0da",
        "panel": "#1c2734",
        "border": "#526174",
        "accent": "#f7c85b"
      },
      "typography": {
        "titleWeight": 750,
        "titleTracking": "0em",
        "titleTransform": "none",
        "bodyLineHeight": 1.5
      },
      "motion": {
        "entranceFrames": 8,
        "holdFrames": 12
      }
    },
    "light": {
      "colors": {
        "bg": "#f7f5f0",
        "ink": "#18212b",
        "muted": "#465363",
        "panel": "#ffffff",
        "border": "#8793a1",
        "accent": "#855800"
      },
      "typography": {
        "titleWeight": 750,
        "titleTracking": "0em",
        "titleTransform": "none",
        "bodyLineHeight": 1.5
      },
      "motion": {
        "entranceFrames": 8,
        "holdFrames": 12
      }
    },
    "velvet": {
      "$comment": "改编自 HyperFrames visual-styles.md 的 Velvet Standard（致敬 Massimo Vignelli）。颜色不是原值照搬：原 accent #1a237e 在近黑底上对比度只有 1.49:1，画面里几乎不可见，故保留靛蓝色相提亮为 #c5cae9（12.25:1）。muted/panel/border 原风格未给，按项目既有的对比度预算派生。typography 只取字重/字距/大小写特征：原风格的字号是 web 尺度（body 1rem），低于本项目 28px 字阶下限，不采用。缓动曲线（sine.inOut / power1.in）不落地——画面仅由帧号驱动，源码闸门拒绝 CSS 动画，动效只能以帧数表达。",
      "colors": {
        "bg": "#0a0a0a",
        "ink": "#ffffff",
        "muted": "#c3c8d8",
        "panel": "#16162b",
        "border": "#6a7099",
        "accent": "#c5cae9"
      },
      "typography": {
        "titleWeight": 300,
        "titleTracking": "0.15em",
        "titleTransform": "uppercase",
        "bodyLineHeight": 1.6
      },
      "motion": {
        "entranceFrames": 36,
        "holdFrames": 90,
        "transitionFrames": 45
      }
    }
  }
}
